# jlptcode Core

- Stack: Next.js App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui, MariaDB/Prisma or MongoDB (`DATABASE_TYPE`)
- Path alias: `@/*` → `src/*`
- Functional components + hooks only; keep components small and reusable
- Style with Tailwind; use shadcn primitives from `@/components/ui/*`
- Prefer existing patterns over new abstractions; minimal diffs
- Feature layout: `src/app/{feature}/`, `api/`, `store/`, `swr/`, `models/`, `components/Layout/`
- Client pages that use hooks/session/store: add `"use client"` at top
- UI strings: use `useTranslations()` + `src/i18n/messages/*.json` (ko, ja, en, cn, my) — no hard-coded user-facing copy
- Paid features: gate with `session?.paymentInfo?.isValid`, `PaidButton`, or `PaidGate` / `useIsPaid`
